abstract: >-
  Formal Lean 4 proof repository, exact rational falsification battery,
  mathematical atlas, and LearnHarness study packs investigating the bridge
  between Optimal Guaranteed Control (OGU) and two-stage Adaptive Robust
  Optimization (ARO), the value of information under closure scheduling,
  and exactness boundaries of affine decision rules (ADR).
